WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.436 --> 00:00:03.386
Lesson thirteen. My Clothes!

2
00:00:04.296 --> 00:00:11.496
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:12.482 --> 00:00:14.055
Coco, I'm getting dressed!

4
00:00:14.105 --> 00:00:15.591
Let's learn clothes!

5
00:00:16.833 --> 00:00:20.133
Shirt! Say it with me. Shirt!

6
00:00:24.132 --> 00:00:27.432
Shorts! Say it with me. Shorts!

7
00:00:31.433 --> 00:00:34.699
Dress! Say it with me. Dress!

8
00:00:38.701 --> 00:00:41.801
Hat! Say it with me. Hat!

9
00:00:45.791 --> 00:00:49.224
Shoes! Say it with me. Shoes!

10
00:00:53.224 --> 00:00:56.724
Socks! Say it with me. Socks!

11
00:01:00.763 --> 00:01:01.775
I wear a hat!

12
00:01:01.825 --> 00:01:08.983
I wear a scarf! What do you wear?

13
00:01:09.033 --> 00:01:10.183
Very nice!

14
00:01:11.340 --> 00:01:17.730
Put on your socks. Then put on your shoes!

15
00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:18.945
Ready to go!

16
00:01:20.188 --> 00:01:22.639
I wear my socks on my hands!

17
00:01:22.689 --> 00:01:26.150
No, Coco! Socks go on your feet! Ha ha!

18
00:01:26.915 --> 00:01:33.465
This is M. M is for moon. Moon! M is for monkey. Monkey!

19
00:01:37.445 --> 00:01:44.274
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

20
00:01:44.324 --> 00:01:45.964
Bye-bye, friends!

